，沒有讓人想回購的優點。",null,[0,133]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17463435873577036106/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXljVFEyVlU5M0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17463435873577036106/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXljVFEyVlU5M0VBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17463435873577036106/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXljVFEyVlU5M0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17463435873577036106/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXljVFEyVlU5M0VBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17463435873577036106/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXljVFEyVlU5M0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17463435873577036106/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXljVFEyVlU5M0VBRRAA"]],[null,null,2137,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQycTQ2VU93EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x12971d343a057476!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID2q46UOw%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQycTQ2VU93EAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQycTQ2VU93Ei4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRDJxNDZVdXdFEhNDZ3dJX0lxNGxBWVEyTG5hc2dFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRDJxNDZVZXcSE0Nnd0lfSXE0bEFZUTJMbmFzZ0UiEgkAAAAAAAAAABF2dAU6NB2XEioLMFhZVkt3TEtkbk4\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiT5qu1ytKWAxXehK8BHdAmF90QoykIjgEoBA"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwj3nLO1ytKWAxVZcF4EHaeZI_kQ0pMFCEIoBQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiT5qu1ytKWAxXehK8BHdAmF90Q0pMFCIYBKAU"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURBX3EtcFJREAE",["0x0:0x12971d343a057476",null,1528367957723000,1552022116080657,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116887029036108706527/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["YI WEN CHIEN (有妖四處飄_文文)","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUl97TCKAA2